{
 "description": "Stable machine-readable technology codes for spectrum-intel signals. Rules are tried in order; the first whose 'decoder' (receiver plugin that defined or decoded the signal, or null for any) and 'label' regex (Python re / ECMAScript compatible, case-sensitive, searched anywhere) both match wins. Shared by the Python and C++ implementations: change it here only, and add a test vector to tests when you do.",
